File Index

/armor.ts
Purpose: Defines armor class multipliers and slot weights for damage mitigation calculations.

/auras.test.ts
Purpose: Tests aura catalog lookups (shield vs reactive) and damage-type filter matching.

/auras.ts
Purpose: Authored aura catalog — shielding (negate/reduce by damage type) + reactive (thorns) auras, plus lookups and a damage-type filter matcher for the combat hooks.

/class-kits.ts
Purpose: Hand-authored tactical class kits (5) + defaultClassKit() deriving a playable kit for every other mortal class from its DSL classGroup archetype + armor tier, so no class lacks a kit.

/legality.ts
Purpose: Race×class legality for army building — raceRestrictions FORBID + csr.requiresRaces ALLOW + CSR gate on a team's single allegiance (religion rolled up); isLegalRaceClass/legalClassesForRace/legalRacesForClass.

/legality.test.ts
Purpose: Tests restriction semantics — forbidden races, requiresRaces allow-list, CSR gating with/without affiliation context, and the legal-classes/legal-races helpers.

/defenses.test.ts
Purpose: Tests dodge/parry/block chances (dex + armor scaling) and the seeded rollAvoidance sequence.

/defenses.ts
Purpose: Authored avoidance tuning (DEFENSE_CONSTANTS) — dodge/parry/shield-block chances + a seeded rollAvoidance the combat hooks roll against.

/modes.ts
Purpose: Defines all game modes' configurations for the simulation system.

/moon-effects.ts
Purpose: Defines moon phase effects on magi spell power with data-driven modifiers.

/race-modifiers.ts
Purpose: Defines racial stat modifiers and traits that adjust class-based character attributes.

/casting.ts
Purpose: Caster-level model — computeCastingLevel = round(LEVEL_CAP 51 × class cast factor) + elf (+1); class affinity (+1) is a distinct DSL concept not yet distilled (NOT the damage boosts). Below-level casters (DSL CastsAtLevel=false) use their CastingLevelModifier.

/racial-traits.ts
Purpose: Authored tactical effects of distilled DSL racial abilities — Toughness (dwarves) → KT defense via a principled DSL-AC→defense conversion (ktDefenseFromDslAc: DSL neg AC = better, ~10 AC≈1%, KT ac/AC_DIVISOR(40); -25 AC ⇒ +1 defense). isElfRace + defense/trait folding for unitTemplate.

/reclass-kits.ts
Purpose: Defines reclass kit overrides for specialized class modifications.

/stances.ts
Purpose: Combat stance catalog — Normal/Offensive/Defensive (all units) + Brewmaster Drunken Monkey/Sloshing/Cripple; each carries to-hit/evasion (avoidance) + damage dealt/taken mods. Normal is a no-op. stanceMod/stancesForClass/isStanceLegalFor.

/stances.test.ts
Purpose: Tests the stance catalog — normal is all-zero, offensive/defensive mirror-signed and general, Brewmaster stances gated to Brewmasters.

/terrain.ts
Purpose: Defines tactical terrain properties for a 2D battlefield grid.

/unit-costs.ts
Purpose: Unit cost models — classPointCost (SOURCE OF TRUTH for army-building budget: base classes flat 10, reclasses 10 + surcharge scaled from DSL BaseCpModifier tier) + the older stat-derived computeUnitCost (power metric).
